        1.0,
        1.25
      ],
      "solver_seconds_per_batch": 10,
      "solver_relative_gap": 0.0,
      "evaluation": "Join nullable known outcomes only after selection. Unknown outcomes consume time and never become on-time labels. Compare realized counts descriptively; no tuning or policy choice using these results.",
      "limits": "Model probabilities unreliable; ranking gain modest. No dispatch, fleet routing, prevented delays, causal uplift, monetary savings or production qualification. Seller cap is a declared concentration limit, not a fairness guarantee; it covers the primary seller only."
